WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:08.540
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:08.540 --> 00:15.500
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:28.860 --> 00:35.060
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

00:35.060 --> 00:42.030
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

00:42.240 --> 00:48.540
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

00:48.540 --> 00:55.680
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

00:58.120 --> 01:05.530
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:05.530 --> 01:11.500
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:11.500 --> 01:19.140
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:19.140 --> 01:26.010
Tooku tooi basho e to

01:32.950 --> 01:36.320
Episode 24
The Yellow Shard of Happiness

01:41.760 --> 01:43.890
Whoa, easy there!

01:45.370 --> 01:49.770
You planning on running off without paying
your debt to the J. Rock Gang?

01:49.770 --> 01:52.440
There's no way I can pay that
outrageous interest!

01:52.440 --> 01:54.680
What was that?!

01:54.680 --> 01:59.680
If you can't pay, then I reckon your prepared
for what's coming, aren't ya?

01:59.680 --> 02:01.920
Oh, dear me.

02:01.920 --> 02:04.710
What an unsavory atmosphere, and in
the middle of the day, no less!

02:05.450 --> 02:07.220
Who the hell are you?

02:07.220 --> 02:13.560
I can't just quietly overlook a frail,
young maiden in trouble.

02:13.560 --> 02:15.530
Don't go giving us the cool guy act, buddy!

02:19.370 --> 02:20.370
Damn...

02:20.370 --> 02:22.840
Doc! It's up to you!

02:22.840 --> 02:24.440
You got it.

02:24.440 --> 02:27.580
Hey, this is just business, nothing personal.

02:27.580 --> 02:29.370
Okay, then!

02:36.890 --> 02:38.850
I got two more!

03:03.010 --> 03:05.350
He... He got me!

03:05.350 --> 03:10.310
Damn! Don't think you can mess with the J.
Rock Gang and get away with it!

03:11.950 --> 03:14.320
Okay, it's all right now.

03:14.320 --> 03:16.290
Huh? Young lady?

03:17.860 --> 03:19.490
Why?

03:23.770 --> 03:26.570
Oh, now I've done it!

03:26.570 --> 03:28.740
Well, don't just stand there!

03:28.740 --> 03:30.770
Just clean it up quickly!

03:30.770 --> 03:33.710
I'll go apologize to the butler.

03:33.710 --> 03:35.340
Sorry!

03:36.080 --> 03:37.580
I'm so sorry!

03:37.580 --> 03:38.750
Yes, yes...

03:38.750 --> 03:41.370
I'll take care of that, just get dinner
preparations underway.

03:43.820 --> 03:46.550
Why is everyone so irresponsible?

03:46.550 --> 03:49.590
I don't say anything, so they get carried away.

03:49.590 --> 03:51.390
Good grief!

03:56.560 --> 03:58.190
Huh?

03:59.570 --> 04:01.360
What's the matter, Miya?

04:02.440 --> 04:05.740
Oh, my! What happened to your face?

04:07.210 --> 04:10.250
You lost the wages you were just paid?

04:10.250 --> 04:12.210
Yeah...

04:12.210 --> 04:16.120
And that's why you borrowed money
from that J. Rock Gang, right?

04:16.120 --> 04:17.820
Right...

04:17.820 --> 04:20.460
Everyone in town says they're
notorious loan sharks,

04:20.460 --> 04:24.260
and terribly aggressive in the way
they go about collecting.

04:24.260 --> 04:26.390
Yeah, but I didn't know that.

04:27.560 --> 04:32.190
And so you ran away from the master of
the house after he rescued you?

04:32.870 --> 04:34.740
Yeah...

04:34.740 --> 04:38.700
If anyone finds out about your debt,
you may lose your job as a maid.

04:39.440 --> 04:43.910
Oh, brother, how could I be so unlucky?

04:43.910 --> 04:45.580
Well, I'll talk to the butler.

04:45.580 --> 04:48.020
Let's see what he has to say.

04:48.020 --> 04:49.750
Oh, there you are!

04:49.750 --> 04:52.020
Look at you slacking off out here!

04:52.020 --> 04:54.690
Huh? What happened to your cheek?

04:54.690 --> 04:56.990
It's nothing you need to worry about!

04:56.990 --> 04:59.620
And what's with that grin?

05:02.060 --> 05:03.860
This right here!

05:10.710 --> 05:11.940
What does it say?

05:11.940 --> 05:13.610
"I cannot bear the way you speak,"

05:13.610 --> 05:16.680
"with that disgusting lisp and all."

05:16.680 --> 05:19.480
"So, let's pretend we never were going steady."

05:21.980 --> 05:26.150
But I lost my tooth and the air
slips through the gap!

05:26.150 --> 05:28.190
There's nothing I can do about it!

05:28.190 --> 05:31.090
I have a feeling that's not the only
thing that disgusted him.

05:31.090 --> 05:33.230
Crying won't do you any good.

05:33.230 --> 05:37.530
Work hard, get yourself a new tooth,
and then look for a new man.

05:38.100 --> 05:39.930
Come on, back to work!

05:39.930 --> 05:43.730
I want to be happy!

05:45.170 --> 05:47.640
Going out, Master Robès?

05:47.640 --> 05:50.240
Yes, I'll return this evening.

05:50.240 --> 05:52.450
Very good, sir.

05:52.450 --> 05:54.450
I'll be hosting a party this evening too.

05:54.450 --> 05:55.580
I'll count on you to get things ready.

05:55.580 --> 05:59.390
B..But, sir, the family's funds are tight as it is!

05:59.390 --> 06:01.060
A party would...

06:01.060 --> 06:02.090
What's this?

06:02.090 --> 06:04.030
Oh, your name was, um...

06:04.030 --> 06:06.790
It's Mickey, sheesh.

06:06.790 --> 06:09.300
I know that, Mickey.

06:09.300 --> 06:12.930
Invite Mickey and Zed to the party tonight.

06:14.970 --> 06:17.810
Is it okay for us to come to the party?

06:17.810 --> 06:19.970
Please do as you like.

06:19.970 --> 06:22.100
Oh, about your bread...

06:25.110 --> 06:27.080
Another party tonight?

06:27.080 --> 06:29.050
The House of Redondo's in trouble now.

06:29.050 --> 06:31.120
N..No way!

06:31.120 --> 06:32.920
Excuse me?

06:34.260 --> 06:37.710
I, uh, I'll leave the bread, right here!

06:44.230 --> 06:48.800
I see, the infamous J. Rock Gang, eh?

06:48.800 --> 06:50.970
Hey, Robès!

06:50.970 --> 06:53.670
Is the master of the house in?

06:53.670 --> 06:55.470
There they are.

06:57.550 --> 07:00.780
The master is out at the moment.

07:00.780 --> 07:03.120
How may I be of assistance?

07:03.120 --> 07:07.180
I hear your master's done a lot for my boys here.

07:08.220 --> 07:10.020
Is that so?

07:10.630 --> 07:14.800
Having the doctor see to their injuries
cost me a pretty sum, you see.

07:14.800 --> 07:18.430
I was thinking I might have your master
cover those expenses.

07:18.430 --> 07:22.140
If that's not going to work out, I did
have another thought in mind.

07:22.140 --> 07:23.930
Isn't that right, Doc?

07:30.380 --> 07:33.410
Oh, I see.

07:33.410 --> 07:36.080
We're not playing around here.

07:36.080 --> 07:37.220
This is business.

07:37.220 --> 07:38.950
I'm scared!

07:38.950 --> 07:40.150
Oh, crap!

07:40.150 --> 07:42.720
I regret to say that we have no money,

07:42.720 --> 07:48.230
but might I interest you in the House of
Redondo's family treasure instead?

07:48.230 --> 07:50.400
Treasure, you say?

07:50.400 --> 07:54.840
It is the family's greatest treasure,
of which even Master Robès is not aware.

07:54.840 --> 07:57.440
It is the Yellow Shard of Fortune,

07:57.440 --> 08:00.410
which brings happiness to
whoever possesses it!

08:01.280 --> 08:03.540
Brings happiness to whoever possesses it?

08:03.540 --> 08:06.410
"Yellow Shard of Fortune"?

08:06.410 --> 08:09.380
Yellow Shard of Fortune, you say?

08:09.380 --> 08:11.150
This isn't some hoax, is it?

08:11.150 --> 08:12.720
Of course not.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.160
Okay, then show it to me.

08:14.160 --> 08:17.160
Unfortunately, it is not here.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.990
What?

08:18.990 --> 08:24.400
The family's greatest treasure is, naturally,
hidden in a secret place!

08:24.400 --> 08:27.170
I shall go fetch it and return by sundown!

08:27.170 --> 08:29.800
Kindly wait until then, if you would.

08:32.140 --> 08:34.140
And you will be back by sundown, won't you?

08:34.140 --> 08:38.010
Because if you're not, we'll be taking
this whole mansion for ourselves!

08:38.010 --> 08:39.710
Certainly.

08:39.710 --> 08:42.680
Now then, if you'll excuse me for a bit.

08:44.520 --> 08:46.220
A shard of good fortune, huh?

08:46.220 --> 08:49.460
He said it brings happiness to whoever has it!

08:49.460 --> 08:51.250
So what?

08:52.990 --> 08:55.030
Don't you want to get a look at it?

08:55.030 --> 08:57.030
Only a look?

08:57.030 --> 08:58.830
Really just a look?

08:58.830 --> 09:01.340
Well, don't you want to be happy?

09:01.340 --> 09:04.710
I figure we have the right to be happy too!

09:04.710 --> 09:09.040
Are you telling me you'd pursue that "right" even
at Master Robès's and the butler's expense?

09:09.040 --> 09:10.840
Well, I didn't, er...

09:13.050 --> 09:15.520
All right, only a look then.

09:16.150 --> 09:17.250
What are you waiting for?

09:17.250 --> 09:19.880
You'd better go after the butler!

09:44.750 --> 09:47.180
Hey, Hina.

09:47.180 --> 09:49.580
Are you happy now?

09:49.580 --> 09:51.880
What, me?

09:54.990 --> 10:00.950
For the longest time, I've always taken on roles
like "boss" or "leader" on purpose.

10:01.900 --> 10:03.690
Do you know why?

10:05.430 --> 10:08.940
I'm certainly not doing it because I want to.

10:08.940 --> 10:11.440
It's because I don't want to be betrayed.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.640
I don't want to be left out by the people I'm with.

10:13.640 --> 10:15.210
Hina...

10:15.210 --> 10:18.950
Even now, I wonder when I'll be
betrayed by those under me.

10:18.950 --> 10:20.980
That won't happen!

10:20.980 --> 10:22.450
That's right...

10:22.450 --> 10:24.950
I've had enough with being betrayed.

10:24.950 --> 10:27.050
As many times as I've been betrayed,

10:27.050 --> 10:29.590
I'm sure that if I betray someone else just once,

10:29.590 --> 10:32.230
God will still forgive me.

10:32.230 --> 10:34.190
I want to be happy!

10:46.440 --> 10:48.410
Please forgive me for undoing this seal.

10:48.410 --> 10:51.710
It is for the sake of the House of Redondo.

11:16.470 --> 11:18.270
Watch out!

11:20.680 --> 11:23.300
Like I was going to wait until sundown!

11:30.280 --> 11:31.890
Not bad, Hina!

11:31.890 --> 11:33.850
I'm seeing you in a new light!

11:40.490 --> 11:43.230
This is a spirit shard, isn't it?

11:43.230 --> 11:47.360
So, does it mean that only a
shard caster can use it?

11:48.370 --> 11:53.440
But it would be way too unfair if only
shard casters could have the happiness!

11:53.440 --> 11:55.010
Good point.

11:55.010 --> 11:57.680
God would never do something like that.

11:57.680 --> 11:59.780
Then, how do we use this thing?

11:59.780 --> 12:01.750
It's got to be like this!

12:05.720 --> 12:07.690
You just made that spell up now, didn't you?

12:07.690 --> 12:08.960
Quiet!

12:08.960 --> 12:13.590
Fairies of happiness, save me!

12:14.060 --> 12:15.330
Let me see.

12:15.330 --> 12:16.630
Hey!

12:19.370 --> 12:22.490
Please, I beg you to grant me happiness.

12:25.040 --> 12:27.510
Please, I beg you!

12:27.510 --> 12:30.480
You can rub it all you want, it won't do a thing.

12:30.480 --> 12:31.780
Ack!

12:35.280 --> 12:37.080
There it is.

12:45.690 --> 12:47.630
Please grant me happiness!

12:47.630 --> 12:48.930
Yeah!

13:01.410 --> 13:05.210
It did its thing just now, didn't it?

13:06.050 --> 13:07.210
Okay!

13:07.210 --> 13:09.050
We don't want to hang around here,

13:09.050 --> 13:11.520
so let's head into town and test this out!

13:17.290 --> 13:18.460
Now then...

13:18.460 --> 13:20.560
I'm pretty hungry,

13:20.560 --> 13:22.530
so how about we grab some lunch here?

13:26.600 --> 13:28.800
Congratulations!

13:28.800 --> 13:32.610
You are our tenth customer!

13:32.610 --> 13:33.740
Tenth?!

13:33.740 --> 13:34.740
Yes, ma'am!

13:34.740 --> 13:37.240
As a token of gratitude,

13:37.240 --> 13:39.850
we offer you a fabulous full-course
meal free of charge!

13:39.850 --> 13:41.780
Please follow me.

13:41.780 --> 13:42.920
Wow...

13:42.920 --> 13:45.150
You're so lucky, Miya!

13:45.150 --> 13:47.280
Talk about instant results!

13:52.890 --> 13:54.860
Who in the world...

13:58.000 --> 14:02.370
That's the first time I've had such bad food...

14:02.370 --> 14:04.970
Can you even call that stuff food?

14:04.970 --> 14:07.370
Well, it was served on plates at least.

14:07.370 --> 14:09.840
I'm going to be sick...

14:09.840 --> 14:11.450
No wonder...

14:11.450 --> 14:15.180
I thought "tenth" was too low a number
for something like that.

14:15.180 --> 14:16.980
Guess I just don't have any luck.

14:16.980 --> 14:19.920
And I even had the Shard of Fortune.

14:19.920 --> 14:21.720
That's funny...

14:23.620 --> 14:26.250
Hey, let me have it next!

14:30.330 --> 14:34.290
I beg you, please grant me...

14:36.140 --> 14:37.930
Please grant me happiness!

14:42.180 --> 14:43.970
It's here!

14:46.880 --> 14:50.010
Please! Make me happy!

14:57.930 --> 15:02.460
C'mon, let's go to the party at Mr. Robès's place.

15:02.460 --> 15:04.700
You'll be able to get free food there.

15:04.700 --> 15:08.840
I got a bad feeling that free food
could end up costing us.

15:08.840 --> 15:12.210
Don't talk like that. Let's go!

15:12.210 --> 15:16.010
You got some other reason you want to go?

15:19.150 --> 15:21.770
You're too easy to read.

15:22.720 --> 15:27.450
You've held my heart captive since the
moment I first laid eyes on you!

15:27.450 --> 15:32.490
I can think of no other companion
to spend my life with than you!

15:32.490 --> 15:35.230
Come, let us be married right away!

15:35.230 --> 15:39.600
Th..This is way too sudden!

15:39.600 --> 15:40.830
What's this, Michel?

15:40.830 --> 15:42.600
Now that young lady?

15:42.600 --> 15:45.040
Yes, that is correct, Mommy!

15:45.040 --> 15:46.970
Allow me to introduce her now!

15:46.970 --> 15:50.080
To think a rich, hot guy like that would
fall in love with her at first sight!

15:50.080 --> 15:51.110
Amazing, huh?

15:51.110 --> 15:54.550
Yes, maybe this shard really does work.

15:55.880 --> 15:57.650
Naturally!

15:57.650 --> 16:00.350
True, Pinot is simply charming,

16:00.350 --> 16:04.990
but none is dearer to me than you, Mommy!

16:04.990 --> 16:06.230
Oh, my, really?

16:06.230 --> 16:08.130
Oh, yes, Mommy.

16:08.130 --> 16:10.260
You're the only girl for me!

16:12.730 --> 16:15.530
N..Nice seeing you!

16:17.400 --> 16:20.110
That was one mean Oedipus complex.

16:20.110 --> 16:23.240
Girls, this shard really doesn't work after all.

16:29.120 --> 16:30.910
We'll have to give it back.

16:32.250 --> 16:33.250
Yeah...

16:33.250 --> 16:36.710
If you were going to try it,
you're almost out of time.

16:40.860 --> 16:43.830
Let me do this too, just one more time!

16:53.540 --> 16:57.340
Please, I... I...

16:59.810 --> 17:01.940
I want to be happy too!

17:11.030 --> 17:12.990
Wh..What is it? An earthquake?

17:13.830 --> 17:15.450
Look!

17:25.940 --> 17:27.740
Watch out! Run!

17:28.740 --> 17:31.210
Miya, Pinot! Quickly!

17:32.380 --> 17:33.010
Hina!

17:33.010 --> 17:34.480
Watch out!
Hina!

17:42.360 --> 17:45.360
For crying out loud, you can be a smooth
operator when you want to be.

17:45.360 --> 17:47.030
N..Not really.

17:47.030 --> 17:50.260
I only said there's a cute girl there, that's all.

17:50.260 --> 17:51.270
What's up here?

17:51.270 --> 17:53.270
It looks like the windmill collapsed!

17:53.270 --> 17:53.770
The windmill?

17:53.770 --> 17:55.600
I heard some woman got caught under it.
The windmill?

17:55.600 --> 17:57.900
They took her off to the hospital just earlier.

18:01.780 --> 18:03.900
You think she'll be okay?

18:08.480 --> 18:10.280
A spirit?

18:19.330 --> 18:23.000
Good grief, that Shard of Fortune story
was a bunch of nonsense!

18:23.000 --> 18:24.630
I'm glad though.

18:24.630 --> 18:27.530
It was a miracle you escaped with
only bumps and bruises.

18:27.530 --> 18:28.670
What are you talking about?

18:28.670 --> 18:30.640
She nearly died!

18:34.640 --> 18:36.270
Miss Hina!

18:39.310 --> 18:41.980
We heard you got caught under
a collapsed windmill.

18:41.980 --> 18:44.320
We got over here as quickly as we could!

18:44.320 --> 18:48.060
If anything ever happened to you,
I don't know what we'd do!

18:48.060 --> 18:50.120
We were completely beside ourselves!

18:50.120 --> 18:54.430
Because we can't do anything without you!

18:54.430 --> 18:56.400
Are you doing all right now?

18:57.660 --> 19:01.290
I'm all right. I made it out with only
some bumps and bruises.

19:01.840 --> 19:03.960
Thank goodness!

19:06.340 --> 19:09.910
You all... just for me?

19:09.910 --> 19:13.680
Thank goodness! I'm so glad!

19:13.680 --> 19:16.080
Miss Hina...

19:16.080 --> 19:19.350
Those are no crocodile tears.

19:19.350 --> 19:22.820
Maybe that thing's a real Shard
of Fortune after all.

19:22.820 --> 19:23.960
You may be right.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.790
Not quite.

19:25.790 --> 19:29.700
You are all victims of a great misunderstanding.

19:29.700 --> 19:31.370
Oh, sir!

19:31.370 --> 19:35.000
That is no "shard of fortune".

19:35.000 --> 19:39.570
It is a cursed shard that brings misfortune
after misfortune to whoever possesses it.

19:39.570 --> 19:41.280
No way!

19:41.280 --> 19:45.610
I was of a mind to teach those
vile rogues a lesson.

19:45.610 --> 19:48.780
Now, please return the shard to me.

19:48.780 --> 19:50.580
Well, actually...

19:51.190 --> 19:53.490
How many times have I got to tell ya?

19:53.490 --> 19:55.820
We're just here for the party!

19:55.820 --> 19:58.030
We don't have anything to do with
that bastard, Robès!

19:58.030 --> 20:00.390
Quiet, kid!

20:00.390 --> 20:05.570
I thought something was up when
the butler didn't come back.

20:05.570 --> 20:09.700
You must be some sort of backup
that butler sent in.

20:09.700 --> 20:11.500
Go on, Doc.

20:12.340 --> 20:14.680
Say your prayers, boy.

20:14.680 --> 20:17.470
It's just not sinking in with you guys, is it?

20:20.450 --> 20:22.420
Wh..What the heck?

20:23.880 --> 20:25.650
Ooh, that's yellow!

20:25.650 --> 20:28.260
That's it, you little bastard!

20:28.260 --> 20:30.420
That's the Yellow Shard of Fortune!

20:30.420 --> 20:33.360
That thing's ours! Hand it over!

20:33.360 --> 20:35.400
Oh, quit your yapping.

20:35.400 --> 20:37.360
If you want it that bad, it's yours.

20:39.670 --> 20:42.790
Ya damn fool, don't handle it so rough.

20:50.380 --> 20:52.170
What the...

20:56.980 --> 20:58.690
There! There it is!

20:58.690 --> 21:00.950
Okay then, for my wish...

21:00.950 --> 21:02.420
First of all, money!

21:02.420 --> 21:04.720
Just give me tons of money!

21:06.930 --> 21:07.930
Whoa, way to go, Boss!

21:07.930 --> 21:09.930
Nice job, Boss!

21:09.930 --> 21:11.470
Bunch of morons...

21:11.470 --> 21:13.000
I'm heading back.

21:13.000 --> 21:14.430
You take care of the rest.

21:14.430 --> 21:16.800
Huh? Me?

21:16.800 --> 21:18.070
Okay!

21:18.070 --> 21:20.200
Go, Armadole!

21:33.720 --> 21:35.520
Well done.

21:35.520 --> 21:38.830
Aw, I didn't want to beat them like this!

21:38.830 --> 21:41.730
This sucks, man! It sucks!

21:41.730 --> 21:43.130
Oh, my!

21:43.130 --> 21:45.530
I was wondering what all this ruckus was about.

21:45.530 --> 21:47.300
Why, Mickey, my lord, you've taken
care of these hoodlums.

21:47.300 --> 21:50.740
Um, well...

21:50.740 --> 21:53.870
Mickey the baker, huh?

21:53.870 --> 21:55.910
That's awesome, Mickey!

21:55.910 --> 21:57.810
You're the best!

21:57.810 --> 21:59.610
Y..You think?

22:03.050 --> 22:04.850
That's amazing, Mickey!

22:04.850 --> 22:07.150
Mickey's the best!

22:09.090 --> 22:10.820
This is...

22:10.820 --> 22:13.790
Well, then, I'll have to seal it away once more.

22:17.830 --> 22:18.900
It can't be!

22:18.900 --> 22:22.640
They couldn't have started the party
without me again, could they?

22:22.640 --> 22:25.210
Hurry! Make haste!

22:25.210 --> 22:27.170
Move it!

22:42.020 --> 22:44.620
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.620 --> 22:47.460
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.460 --> 22:52.420
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.770 --> 22:58.410
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.410 --> 23:04.370
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.420 --> 23:14.820
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.820 --> 23:18.620
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.330 --> 23:23.060
Kono michi o tobashite

23:23.060 --> 23:30.530
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.200 --> 23:33.870
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.870 --> 23:36.640
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.640 --> 23:41.600
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.120 --> 23:47.650
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.650 --> 23:53.790
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:16.850 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
